Chapter 1: Why Do We Need Sliding Window?

Suppose the array is

[2, 4, 1, 6, 3, 8]

Question:

Find the maximum sum of 3 consecutive elements.

Brute Force

Check every possible group.

2 4 1 = 7

4 1 6 = 11

1 6 3 = 10

6 3 8 = 17

Maximum = 17

Code:

for(int i = 0; i <= n-k; i++)
{
    int sum = 0;

    for(int j = i; j < i+k; j++)
        sum += nums[j];
}

Time Complexity:

O(n*k)

If

n = 100000
k = 50000

this becomes extremely slow.

